# Intentionally empty.
#
# pixi.toml points R_MAKEVARS_USER at this file so that a personal
# ~/.R/Makevars (paths to a Homebrew libomp, another project's thirdParty
# tree, ...) cannot leak into the FELIX build inside the pixi environment.
# Everything FELIX needs comes from .pixi/envs/default and src/Makevars.
